{"id":"38a2b1dd1ba50fd4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/546_Japaridze_多模态可证性逻辑_GLP.md","title":"546 Japaridze 多模态可证性逻辑 GLP","display":"546_Japaridze_多模态可证性逻辑_GLP","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OrdMode}_{546}=\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OrdMode}_{546}=\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}_m\\ (m\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}_m\\ (m\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[m]A=\\operatorname{box}_m(A),\n\\qquad\n\\langle m\\rangle A:=\\neg[m]\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[m]A=\\operatorname{box}_m(A),\n\\qquad\n\\langle m\\rangle A:=\\neg[m]\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其余显示约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}_m(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}_m(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与结构等价\">3. 自由变元与结构等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{546}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{546}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{box}_m(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(\\operatorname{box}_m(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{546}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言无绑定，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{546}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{546}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{546}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{546}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,546}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,546}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{546}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{546}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{546})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{546}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{546}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}_m(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}_m(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}_m(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}_m(\\operatorname{Sub}_{546}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m](A\\to B)\\to([m]A\\to[m]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m](A\\to B)\\to([m]A\\to[m]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]([m]A\\to A)\\to[m]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]([m]A\\to A)\\to[m]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&lt;n\">\\(m&lt;n\\)</span>，定义交互公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]A\\to[n]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]A\\to[n]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{\\langle m\\rangle A\\to[n]\\langle m\\rangle A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{\\langle m\\rangle A\\to[n]\\langle m\\rangle A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546})\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546})\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{((A),[m]A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\n=\n\\{((A),[m]A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其显示形式与载体类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{[m]A}\\ (Nec_m),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{[m]A}\\ (Nec_m),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{546}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{546}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{r-1},A_{r-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{r-1},A_{r-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;0\">\\(r&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;r\">\\(i&lt;r\\)</span>，下列四项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;r}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;r}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{546}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{r-1},A_{r-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{546}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{r-1},A_{r-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{546}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{546}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{546}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{546}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{546}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{546}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{546}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{546}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{546}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标特征是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为模态索引，并包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&lt;n\">\\(m&lt;n\\)</span> 时的两类已定义交互公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]A\\to[n]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{[m]A\\to[n]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{\\langle m\\rangle A\\to[n]\\langle m\\rangle A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}\n=\n\\{\\langle m\\rangle A\\to[n]\\langle m\\rangle A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合被固定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546})\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{546}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{546}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{546}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{546}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{546}\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,m}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L,m}^{546})\n\\cup\n\\bigcup_{m&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon,m,n}^{546}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mix,m,n}^{546}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{GLP}_{546}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{OrdMode}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{546},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{546},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,546},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{546},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546})_{m\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{546},\n\\vdash_{546}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{GLP}_{546}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{OrdMode}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{546},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{546},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{546},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,546},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{546},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{546},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,m}^{546})_{m\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{546},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{546},\n\\vdash_{546}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含多模态可证性句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含序数解释、算术解释、拓扑语义、赋值或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与结构等价","text":"3. 自由变元与结构等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OrdMode}_{546}=\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}_m\\ (m\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"[m]A=\\operatorname{box}_m(A),\n\\qquad\n\\langle m\\rangle A:=\\neg[m]\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{546}","display":false},{"tex":"\\